<title>THAILAND: Int'l Engineering 1996 net up sharply.</title>
<headline>Int'l Engineering 1996 net up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated financial results</p>
<p>for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>					  Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		9.56	vs	    4.57</p>
<p>    Net		     398.31	vs	  182.35</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is International Engineering Plc, a telecom firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
